#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""td_astro_stack - Astrophotography RAW & Image Stacker with Star Alignment & ISO Normalization.

Automatically groups photos by shutter speed, performs sub-pixel star alignment (SIFT + RANSAC),
normalizes exposure gains across varying ISOs (preserving linear dynamic range), and stacks frames
using ultra-low RAM disk-buffered memory-mapped streaming (np.memmap) with sigma-clipping outlier
rejection to maximize Signal-to-Noise Ratio (SNR) and remove satellite trails, hot pixels, and cosmic rays.

Outputs a 16-bit linear master TIFF and an auto-stretched (MTF / arcsinh) 8-bit preview PNG.

Author: Ansh Dadwal (T-Dynamos) & Antigravity
License: MIT
"""

